stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    state "Đang tải applications + reports" as Loading
    state "Không có gì để export" as Nothing
    state "Sẵn sàng export" as Ready
    state "Lỗi tải" as LoadError
    state "Đang export (progress 0–1)" as Exporting
    state "PDF đã upload" as Uploaded
    state "Report đã lưu" as Saved
    state "Export lỗi" as ExportFailed

    [*] --> Loading
    Loading --> Ready: applications có dữ liệu
    Loading --> Nothing: applications ViewEmpty
    Loading --> LoadError: AppException → Retry
    LoadError --> Loading: Retry
    Nothing --> Ready: có application mới (stream live)

    Ready --> Exporting: Export report / Export again
    Nothing --> Nothing: bấm Export bị chặn "nothing to export"
    Exporting --> ExportFailed: build PDF hoặc upload lỗi
    Exporting --> Uploaded: upload Storage đạt 100%
    Uploaded --> Saved: ghi metadata users/&#123;uid&#125;/reports OK
    Uploaded --> ExportFailed: ghi metadata lỗi (file còn, chưa có row)
    Saved --> Ready: reports stream có row mới
    ExportFailed --> Exporting: Retry
    Saved --> Saved: Export lại cùng ngày → cùng doc id, ghi đè

    note right of Exporting
      Bấm lặp bị bỏ qua khi progress != null.
      Progress lấy từ FileStorageService.uploadPdf.
    end note

    note right of Saved
      Chỉ lưu metadata sau khi upload thành công: không có URL giả.
      Một document mỗi ngày (id = tên file bỏ .pdf).
      export_report chỉ log khi report đã tồn tại (analytics row 14).
    end note
